PRIOR-WORK CHECK (a READY without a PRIOR WORK section is returned). No deploy, no PR, no merge to main, no Jira, no mail, no message to any human. Never delete (quarantine). Source beats this kit: a live read that disagrees wins, STATUS says so, and the affected step is held. Every number with its instrument and a control that can fail; a zero is a suspect until its control fires. Never dismiss an alert; an intended behaviour is a finding to report.


